# LeetCode 596 — Classes More Than 5 Students

## 📌 Problem

Find all classes that have at least five students.

## 🛠️ Approach

* Used `GROUP BY` to group records by class.
* Used `COUNT(student)` to count students in each class.
* Used `HAVING` to filter classes with at least 5 students.

## 💻 SQL Solution

```sql
SELECT class
FROM Courses
GROUP BY class
HAVING COUNT(student) >= 5;
```

## 🧠 Key Learnings

* `GROUP BY` groups rows with the same class.
* `COUNT()` counts non-NULL values.
* `HAVING` filters groups after aggregation, unlike `WHERE`, which filters individual rows before grouping.

## 🎯 Concepts Practiced

`GROUP BY` | `COUNT()` | `HAVING`

